    "\"b)\" quad (10^9 times 1.7) / (2.5 times 10^9) = 0.68 \"s\"",
    "\"c)\" quad (2.5 times 10^9) / (1.7 times 10^6) approx 1471",
    "\"d)\" quad \"CPI\" = 1.7 - 0.2 times 1 = 1.5, quad 0.6 \"s\", quad 0.68 / 0.6 approx 1.13",
